  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 100eb (Premium) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Enhances:</strong> All Bulletproof Shields</p>\n<p><em>There’s a reason smaller shields were used for centuries in melee.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Shield Enhancement.</strong> The shield’s HP is reduced by 2. While the shield is being utilized and has any remaining HP, the user is considered to have one more free hand for the purposes of Grabs/Grapples and Martial Arts Special Moves. This does not count as having an additional arm.</p>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> Shield Enhancement<br>\n<strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Shield Attachments and Enhancements follow the Armor Attachment and Enhancement rules, but for Bulletproof Shields, including cyberware ones; not for vehicle Bulletproof Glass. Corgo's optional rule: a Bulletproof Shield with HP left puts its wielder in Cover and counts as a 2x2m/yds piece of Cover against Suppressive Fire, which they may share with one adjacent character.</li>\n<li>-2 shield HP (automated).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Armor &amp; Fashion &gt; Shields).</em></p>"
